# The image needs only the project, its lock, its README (the project's readme,
# which building the project reads), its licence, its source, and the example
# configuration; nothing else of the directory enters the build context, in
# particular no environment, frp download, or build output.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!examples/config.toml
**/__pycache__
